[[Image:Is divine.gif|right|Divination]]

Spells from the '''divination''' [[spell school]] are capable of looking forward in time to anticipate what will happen next. Although mostly useful for gathering information, several divination spells help the caster in combat situations.

'''Prohibited school:''' [[illusion]]<br />
'''Prohibited to:''' necromancers

== Spells ==

The divination spells are the following, organized by [[innate level]].
All of these can be cast by [[wizard]]s (other than necromancers).

